# Add directories or file patterns to ignore during indexing (e.g. foo/ or *.csv)
.nia-sync/
.nia_sync_local/
~/.nia-sync/

# AGENTS.md files bundled inside skills. Cursor applies one found in a skill directory
# as an always-on workspace rule, and falls back to the next skill root when
# one is ignored, so every root is listed. Each skill still loads through its
# SKILL.md and individual rule files.
.cursor/skills/*/AGENTS.md
.claude/skills/*/AGENTS.md
.agents/skills/*/AGENTS.md
